\\frac{n(n-1)}{2!}{x}^{2}+⋯.\n$$\n\nIn particular, the ${x}^{4}$ term is given by\n\n$$\n\\frac{n(n-1)(n-2)(n-3)}{4!}{x}^{4}.\n$$\n\nReplacing $x$ with $\\frac{2u}{3}$ and $n$ with $6$ in the above expression, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{6(6-1)(6-2)(6-3)}{4!}\\cdot {(\\frac{2u}{3})}^{4} & =\\frac{6\\cdot 5\\cdot 4\\cdot 3}{24}\\cdot {(\\frac{2}{3})}^{4}\\cdot {u}^{4} \\\\  & =15\\cdot \\frac{16}{81}{u}^{3} \\\\  & =\\frac{80}{27}{u}^{3}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the coefficient of ${u}^{4}$ is $\\frac{80}{27}.$" 13194139534380 true] [17592186285061 1000 #edb/ref 17592186285062 13194139534380 true] [17592186285061 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139534380 true] [17592186285061 1041 "field-1" 13194139534380 true] [17592186285061 1104 #edb/ref 17592186285062 13194139534380 true] [17592186285061 1110 #uuid "52a6a249-284d-5b4f-8208-f8521ad70a82" 13194139534380 true] [17592186285062 1034 "\\frac{80}{27}" 13194139534380 true] [17592186285062 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534380 true] [17592186285062 1111 #uuid "32b3da48-9d0a-5324-8a79-e74b5aea5fbb" 13194139534380 true]] :edb/tempids {"q-113628" 17592186284993 "q-113628/selection" 17592186284994 "q-113628/selection/0fadf1546d47c698e0998420a8e2187a7b6d02256051988bcc2eb7372f567c4d" 17592186284995 "q-113628/selection/6f7b098bd79a3d7d9d1ed6628e8c42e956a6e669d371a21cca1f1a2da684d9f8" 17592186284996 "q-113628/selection/82695551c400a72f11534359df8a4c189c3ebbbbfd2efed5479272382ad17b82" 17592186284997 "q-113628/selection/aef09aa2ee70bd1b8f915f719da68b47211fd421af05d99d11d8edafe288ecaf" 17592186284998 "q-113628/selection/f9f202e9ab5753110fc056814a55b578d8c08ca21d411d87d247861eda7b34b2" 17592186284999 "q-12965" 17592186285000 "q-12965/selection" 17592186285001 "q-12965/selection/72f47e0037ba8169f3cc7330543d3437b7ef4371776d3a4ae6f7d82b2c68d0f7" 17592186285002 "q-12965/selection/7578089d7f2fc2fe9e42fe25a66a9cc65bd623a46d8b1974ec81790120a30bd2" 17592186285003 "q-12965/selection/ad486f2c2090dcdefb14d1dda1190770f6a